[node name="RoomFireC" type="Node2D" unique_id=1799243404]
editor_description = "Stage F4 test room. All elements, starts with 2 pips. Q = fireball (tap throws, hold aims in slow motion, C cancels and keeps the pip; 0 pips = fizzle). 1: fireball the brazier across the pit to open the door, jet over. 2: timed brazier (notched post, 1.8 s) races its door. 3: the tunnel brazier can only be reached with the jet: fly up the chimney and along the tunnel."
